<title>UK: Credit Europeen sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Europeen sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Europeen-BBL.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT EUROPEEN SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     *5.75     MATURITY    18.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE 17/18.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.17 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE, 7.0 PCT FOR YEARS SIX TO</p>
<p>		 EIGHT AND 8.50 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
